# resale-ops (cloud)

Follow the **resale-ops** skill. Load locations from this rule first; if Drive MCP is connected, also read the private `.resale-locations.json` file inside the `Resale` Drive folder (must match).

## resale-locations

```json
{
  "version": 1,
  "drive": {
    "resale_folder_id": "REPLACE",
    "queue_folder_id": "REPLACE",
    "resale_folder_url": "REPLACE",
    "queue_folder_url": "REPLACE"
  },
  "sheets": {
    "spreadsheet_id": "REPLACE",
    "queue_tab": "Queue",
    "spreadsheet_url": "REPLACE"
  },
  "defaults": {
    "city": "REPLACE",
    "platforms": ["avito", "youla"],
    "language": ""
  }
}
```

## Routine

- Phone uploads → `queue/<item-id>/inbox/` in cloud
- Sanitize → `photos/post/` via temp workspace + prepare script or equivalent
- Persist `listing.md`, `meta.json`, Queue sheet row via MCP
- Never ask for folder/spreadsheet IDs again unless the block above is empty
- No marketplace login or auto-publish in prepare_only
